  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n* fix: chart every data point of a metric, not just the last one by @xhua026 in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/469\r\n* fix: avoid panic when a number metric has no data points by @ymtdzzz in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/472\r\n\r\n### Others\r\n* [Automated] Update Nix Flake by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/445\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 21 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/447\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group in /tuiexporter with 3 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/448\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group across 1 directory with 6 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/450\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group in /tuiexporter with 8 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/452\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 17 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/454\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group in /tuiexporter with 7 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/455\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group across 1 directory with 19 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/457\r\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/icza/gox from 0.2.9 to 0.2.14 in /tuiexporter in the dependencies group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/458\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group in /tuiexporter with 6 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/460\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group across 1 directory with 17 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/462\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group in /tuiexporter with 6 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/463\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group across 1 directory with 17 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/465\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group in /tuiexporter with 6 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/466\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group across 1 directory with 16 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/468\r\n* chore(deps): bump the dependencies group with 21 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/471\r\n* [Automated] Update otel-tui/tuiexporter version by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/473\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @xhua026 made their first contribution in https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/pull/469\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ymtdzzz/otel-tui/compare/v0.7.3...v0.7.4",
